review-stage/codex_v9_review_r2_raw.out:1391:./AnomaClaw/LITERATURE_SURVEY.md:4:**Topic**: MLLM-based universal visual anomaly detection agent + active learning
review-stage/codex_v9_review_r2_raw.out:1395:./AnomaClaw/LITERATURE_SURVEY.md:75:The intersection of (1) training-free cross-domain AD, (2) genuine agent-based reasoning, and (3) human-in-the-loop active learning is completely unoccupied. A universal AD agent tested across 8+ domains with GPT/SeedVL backends would be the first of its kind. If existing benchmarks are too large, a carefully sampled cross-domain benchmark would itself be a contribution.
