review-stage/codex_v9_review_r2_raw.out:1467:./benchmark/results/active_learning/al_qwen35_D5.json:1:{"domain": "D5", "k": 10, "fewshot_k": 3, "selection": "uncertainty", "oracle_items": [{"item_id": "D5_0046", "query_path": "/hdd1/jiangxi/AD-Agent/MMAD/dataset/MMAD/MVTec-LOCO/pushpins/test/good/036.png", "label": 0, "score": 0.15, "rationale": "The query image shows a standard arrangement of yellow push pins in a plastic organizer, consistent with the reference images. No missing pins, damage, or unusual patterns are observed.", "error": null}, {"item_id": "D5_0121", "query_path": "/hdd1/jiangxi/AD-Agent/MMAD/dataset/MMAD/MVTec-LOCO/breakfast_box/test/structural_anomalies/054.png", "label": 1, "score": 0.85, "rationale": "The query image is anomalous because it contains a yellowish-green apple, while all reference images consistently show a reddish apple or peach in the same position. This deviation in fruit type/color is a clear anomaly.", "error": null}, {"item_id": "D5_0079", "query_path": "/hdd1/jiangxi/AD-Agent/MMAD/dataset/MMAD/MVTec-LOCO/breakfast_box/test/good/056.png", "label": 0, "score": 0.08, "rationale": "The query image displays a normal arrangement of food items in a lunchbox. The variations in the placement of fruits and snacks are consistent with the natural variations observed in the reference images, confirming the image is not anomalous.", "error": null}, {"item_id": "D5_0047", "query_path": "/hdd1/jiangxi/AD-Agent/MMAD/dataset/MMAD/MVTec-LOCO/pushpins/test/good/017.png", "label": 0, "score": 0.08, "rationale": "The query image shows a standard arrangement of push pins consistent with the reference images; no unique defects or anomalies were found upon comparison.", "error": null}, {"item_id": "D5_0055", "query_path": "/hdd1/jiangxi/AD-Agent/MMAD/dataset/MMAD/MVTec-LOCO/splicing_connectors/test/good/023.png", "label": 0, "score": 0.92, "rationale": "The query image contains an orange wire connecting the terminal blocks, whereas all reference ima