s consistently show a blue wire. This color discrepancy is a clear anomaly.", "error": null}, {"item_id": "D5_0144", "query_path": "/hdd1/jiangxi/AD-Agent/MMAD/dataset/MMAD/MVTec-LOCO/juice_bottle/test/structural_anomalies/078.png", "label": 1, "score": 0.92, "rationale": "The query image contains a clearly torn and incomplete bottom label, which is absent in all reference images where the label is intact. This confirms the image is anomalous.", "error": null}, {"item_id": "D5_0171", "query_path": "/hdd1/jiangxi/AD-Agent/MMAD/dataset/MMAD/MVTec-LOCO/juice_bottle/test/logical_anomalies/127.png", "label": 1, "score": 0.92, "rationale": "The query image shows a bottle with white liquid and an orange label, whereas all reference images show bottles with orange/yellow liquid and an orange label. This mismatch between the liquid content and the label imagery is a clear anomaly.", "error": null}, {"item_id": "D5_0156", "query_path": "/hdd1/jiangxi/AD-Agent/MMAD/dataset/MMAD/MVTec-LOCO/splicing_connectors/test/structural_anomalies/038.png", "label": 1, "score": 0.92, "rationale": "The query image contains a distinct black marking on the orange wire that is absent in all reference images, confirming it as an anomaly.", "error": null}, {"item_id": "D5_0142", "query_path": "/hdd1/jiangxi/AD-Agent/MMAD/dataset/MMAD/MVTec-LOCO/splicing_connectors/test/structural_anomalies/080.png", "label": 1, "score": 0.92, "rationale": "The query image contains a yellow wire, while all reference images show either orange or blue wires. This distinct color difference confirms the image is anomalous.", "error": null}, {"item_id": "D5_0023", "query_path": "/hdd1/jiangxi/AD-Agent/MMAD/dataset/MMAD/MVTec-LOCO/juice_bottle/test/good/067.png", "label": 0, "score": 0.95, "rationale": "The query image is anomalous because the label displays a banana icon and the liquid is white, whereas all reference images show an orange icon and yellow liquid. The side-by-side comparison confirmed the label icon difference is unique to the query.", "error": null}], "passive": [{"item_id": "D5_0060", "score": 0.95, "label_gt": 0, "domain_code": "D5", "rationale": "The query image contains a blue wire, while all reference images consistently show an orange wire. This distinct color difference confirms the image is anomalous.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D5_0040", "score": 0.92, "label_gt": 0, "domain_code": "D5", "rationale": "The query image contains a blue wire connecting the terminal blocks, while all reference images consistently show an orange wire. This color deviation is a clear anomaly.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D5_0016", "score": 0.05, "label_gt": 0, "domain_code": "D5", "rationale": "The observed differences in liquid color and label icon are explicitly listed as allowed variations in the reference profile, so the image is normal.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D5_0051", "score": 0.05, "label_gt": 0, "domain_code": "D5", "rationale": "The side-by-side comparison confirmed that the push pin in the top-left corner of the query image exhibits normal variation consistent with the reference images. No other anomalies were detected.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D5_0062", "score": 0.05, "label_gt": 0, "domain_code": "D5", "rationale": "The query image exhibits a different fruit label (cherry vs orange) and liquid color (red vs yellow), but the reference profiler explicitly defines 'fruit label variation' and 'liquid color variation' as allowed normal variations. Therefore, the image is not anomalous.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D5_0069", "score": 0.05, "label_gt": 0, "domain_code": "D5", "rationale": "The query image exhibits variations in liquid color and fruit label, which are explicitly listed as allowed variations in the reference profile. Therefore, no anomaly is detected.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D5_0071", "score": 0.05, "label_gt": 0, "domain_code": "D5", "rationale": "The query image shows a standard arrangement of healthy food items (oranges, peach, granola, nuts, banana chips) that matches the content and natural variations observed in the reference images. No anomalies were detected.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D5_0065", "score": 0.05, "label_gt": 0, "domain_code": "D5", "rationale": "The query image contains the same set of components (two bolts, two hex nuts, two flat washers) as the reference images. The initial suspicion of an anomaly was refuted by the side-by-side comparison, confirming the image is normal.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D5_0006", "score": 0.05, "label_gt": 0, "domain_code": "D5", "rationale": "The query image exhibits only allowed variations (pin orientation and density) compared to the reference images. No defects or anomalies were detected.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D5_0058", "score": 0.05, "label_gt": 0, "domain_code": "D5", "rationale": "The query image contains the same set of hardware components (2 bolts, 2 nuts, 2 washers) as the reference images. The difference in arrangement is an allowed variation according to the reference profile, and no defects are present.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D5_0049", "score": 0.05, "label_gt": 0, "domain_code": "D5", "rationale": "The query image contains the same set of hardware components (2 bolts, 2 nuts, 2 washers) as the reference images. The difference in arrangement is an allowed variation according to the reference profile, so the image is normal.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D5_0022", "score": 0.05, "label_gt": 0, "domain_code": "D5", "rationale": "The query image displays yellow push pins in a plastic organizer with variations in orientation and density per compartment. The reference profiler confirms these are allowed variations, and no other anomalies like broken pins or foreign objects are observed. Therefore, the image is considered normal.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D5_0019", "score": 0.05, "label_gt": 0, "domain_code": "D5", "rationale": "The query image exhibits a red liquid and a cherry label, which are explicitly listed as allowed variations (liquid color and fruit label) in the reference profile. Therefore, the image is normal.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D5_0039", "score": 0.92, "label_gt": 0, "domain_code": "D5", "rationale": "The query image displays an orange wire connected to two terminals on each side. However, the reference images establish a pattern where orange wires are connected to three terminals, and only blue wires are connected to two terminals. This deviation from the established normal configuration confirms the image is anomalous.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D5_0036", "score": 0.05, "label_gt": 0, "domain_code": "D5", "rationale": "The side-by-side comparison confirmed that the features in the query image's central region are consistent with the reference images, indicating no anomaly.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D5_0123", "score": 0.05, "label_gt": 1, "domain_code": "D5", "rationale": "The side-by-side comparison confirms that the label on the query image is identical to the reference images, with no unique defects or anomalies detected.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D5_0176", "score": 0.92, "label_gt": 1, "domain_code": "D5", "rationale": "The query image displays an orange wire connecting the terminal blocks, whereas all reference images consistently show a blue wire. This color discrepancy is a definitive anomaly.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D5_0131", "score": 0.05, "label_gt": 1, "domain_code": "D5", "rationale": "The side-by-side comparison confirmed that the pin arrangement in the query image is consistent with the reference images, showing no signs of anomaly.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D5_0152", "score": 0.05, "label_gt": 1, "domain_code": "D5", "rationale": "The query image exhibits only allowed variations (pin orientation and density) compared to the reference images, with no other defects observed.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D5_0105", "score": 0.95, "label_gt": 1, "domain_code": "D5", "rationale": "The query image contains an orange wire, whereas all reference images consistently show a blue wire. This color discrepancy is a clear anomaly.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D5_0108", "score": 0.05, "label_gt": 1, "domain_code": "D5", "rationale": "The side-by-side comparison confirmed that the label text '100% Juice' in the query image is identical to the reference images, refuting the initial candidate feature. No other anomalies were observed, leading to a conclusion that the image is normal.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D5_0175", "score": 0.92, "label_gt": 1, "domain_code": "D5", "rationale": "The query image is anomalous because the connecting wire is yellow, whereas all reference images show a red wire. Additionally, the terminal blocks are spaced closer together in the query image.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D5_0110", "score": 0.05, "label_gt": 1, "domain_code": "D5", "rationale": "The query image displays a standard arrangement of lunchbox items that matches the natural variations seen in the reference images, with no unique defects or anomalies detected.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D5_0155", "score": 0.88, "label_gt": 1, "domain_code": "D5", "rationale": "The bottom label is normal, but the query image exhibits a peeling top label and a distinct red liquid color not found in the reference images, confirming it as anomalous.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D5_0134", "score": 0.15, "label_gt": 1, "domain_code": "D5", "rationale": "The query image shows a bottle of cherry juice, while the references show orange and banana juice. The differences in liquid color and label icon are consistent with different product flavors and do not indicate a defect. No other anomalies are observed.", "n_turns": 1, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D5_0090", "score": 0.92, "label_gt": 1, "domain_code": "D5", "rationale": "The query image contains an orange peel segment in the fruit compartment, which is not present in any of the reference images that only show whole fruits. This confirms the image is anomalous.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D5_0126", "score": 0.05, "label_gt": 1, "domain_code": "D5", "rationale": "The query image exhibits features (yellow wire, short length) that are explicitly listed as allowed variations in the reference profile. No anomalous features were detected.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D5_0177", "score": 0.92, "label_gt": 1, "domain_code": "D5", "rationale": "The query image exhibits a clear tear on the bottom edge of the plastic bag, a defect not present in any of the reference images which all show intact packaging.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D5_0093", "score": 0.05, "label_gt": 1, "domain_code": "D5", "rationale": "The query image shows a cherry juice bottle, while references show orange and banana juice. The label text '100% Juice' and bottle structure are consistent across all images. The difference in fruit and color is a natural product variation, not an anomaly.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}, {"item_id": "D5_0122", "score": 0.05, "label_gt": 1, "domain_code": "D5", "rationale": "The query image shows a standard set of hardware (bolts, nuts, washers) in a plastic bag, consistent with the reference images. The side-by-side comparison confirmed that the arrangement and components are normal variations found in the reference set, with no unique defects or missing parts.", "n_turns": 2, "error": null}], "active": [{"item_id": "D5_0040", "score": 0.92, "label_gt": 0, "domain_code": "D5", "fewshot": [{"p": "/hdd1/jiangxi/AD-Agent/MMAD/dataset/MMAD/MVTec-LOCO/splicing_connectors/test/structural_anomalies/038.png", "l": 1, "s": 0.9202715754508972}, {