codex
The manifest inspection confirms §5 uses `manifests_v2` taxonomy, while §4 and the appendix still describe the older domain-code mapping. That is not a cosmetic issue: claims like “D5 logical” and “D9 brain MRI” mean different things across sections unless the paper explicitly declares the remapping.
