benchmark/results/v3_fixed/gpt_v9_sj_k4_test_D5c.json:3271:            "description": "Query shows a large irregular folded/overlapping upper lobe-like component attached above the main body, creating a stacked bilobed appearance not seen in the references, which each show a single compact blob.",
